---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

// AI-GENERATED PLACEHOLDER: title and description
---

<Base title="Books" description="Books written by Aaron Saray.">
  <main id="main" class="page-column">
    <h1 class="page-title">Books</h1>
    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-8">
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <a
            href="https://saray.me/look-at-this-guy"
            class="text-ink underline decoration-accent/60 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-white hover:decoration-accent"
            >WROX: Professional PHP Design Patterns</a
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          (ISBN: 978-0470496701) This book helps bridge the divide between the
          traditional design pattern books and the average PHP developer. Learn
          how to apply all the true, time-tested patterns in object-oriented
          PHP.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <a
            href="/2017/33-things-book/"
            class="text-ink underline decoration-accent/60 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-white hover:decoration-accent"
            >33 Things I Wish Somebody Would Have Told Me</a
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          This book details - you guessed it - 33 things that I wish someone
          would have mentioned to be before or during my programming and
          management career. A more conversational read, this shares lessons
          I've learned "the hard way" in a language or technical
          disipline-agnostic format.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <a
            href="https://nocompromises.gumroad.com/l/securing-laravel"
            class="text-ink underline decoration-accent/60 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-white hover:decoration-accent"
            >Securing Laravel</a
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          A free e-book I created (edited/reviewed by Joel Clermont) containing
          7 steps to lock down and secure a Laravel application. Considered the
          intro material for the Secure Coding Laravel video course.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <a
            href="https://nocompromises.gumroad.com/l/little-laravel"
            class="text-ink underline decoration-accent/60 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-white hover:decoration-accent"
            >A Little Bit of Laravel</a
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          A free e-book authored by Joel Clermont and I giving more than 15
          Laravel-based tips and tricks with thorough explanation, rationale,
          and code examples.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <a
            href="https://nocompromises.gumroad.com/l/laravel-validation"
            class="text-ink underline decoration-accent/60 underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-white hover:decoration-accent"
            >Mastering Laravel Validation Rules</a
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">
          This ebook, co-authored with Joel Clermont, focuses on the validation
          system in the PHP framework Laravel.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </main>
</Base>
